raphIndex":31,"tableIndex":null,"rowIndex":null,"cellIndex":null,"renderedPage":2,"printedPage":2,"pdfPage":2,"equationObjectId":null},"quote":"两条直线不在同一平面上，既不相交也不平行．","quoteRepresentation":"native_xml_text_verbatim","quoteCompleteness":"原XML文字层逐字拼接。","wordingChecked":true,"mathChecked":true,"mathSourceAsset":null,"rawMetadataRetainedInOriginalJson":true,"resource":{"url":null,"sourceId":"L046","requestedPath":"increments/u05-u08-l041-l046-v4/evidence/L046/page-2.png","kind":"missing_source_page","sha256":null,"bytes":null},"originalUrl":"source-original/L046.docx","sourceTitle":"10.2直线与直线的位置关系(2)-教学设计","sourceStatus":"partially_reviewed"},{"id":"ev:book3:L046:para34:skew-context:4","sourceId":"L046","sourceSha256":"d214b96814c31e980e893179334258ec5a83553394bee7113a46d4d0adfcb0c8","locator":{"headingPath":["东方明珠与马路、高铁与高速公路的异面情境"],"part":"word/document.xml","paragraphIndex":34,"tableIndex":null,"rowIndex":null,"cellIndex":null,"renderedPage":2,"printedPage":2,"pdfPage":2,"equationObjectId":null,"renderedPageEnd":3,"printedPageEnd":3,"pdfPageEnd":3},"quote":"如图所示，我们发现刚才每个现实情境中抽象出的两条直线都既不平行也不相交，这就是我们今天这节课要学习的异面直线，在初中我们直观感受过异面直线，今天我们将对它进一步研究．","quoteRepresentation":"native_xml_text_verbatim","quoteCompleteness":"原XML文字层逐字拼接。","wordingChecked":true,"mathChecked":true,"mathSourceAsset":null,"rawMetadataRetainedInOriginalJson":true,"resource":{"url":null,"sourceId":"L046","requestedPath":"increments/u05-u08-l041-l046-v4/evidence/L046/page-2.png","kind":"missing_source_page","sha256":null,"bytes":null},"originalUrl":"source-original/L046.docx","sourceTitle":"10.2直线与直线的位置关系(2)-教学设计","sourceStatus":"partially_reviewed"}],"bodyAssets":{},"formulaRecords":[]},{"id":"lesson-content:book3:L046:skew-definition","nodeId":"kp:21307","proposedNodeId":null,"kind":"contrast","origin":"editorial_proposal","title":"异面直线定义及长方体辨析","scope":"L046相应具体问题或教学活动；此范围说明为编辑文字","blocks":[{"role":"context","type":"text","value":"像上述这种不在同一个平面上，既不相交也不平行的两条直线是空间中特有的一种两直线位置关系．","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L046:para38:skew-definition:0"]},{"role":"context","type":"text","value":"定义 不同在任何一个平面上的两条直线叫做异面直线．","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L046:para39:skew-definition:1"]},{"role":"question","type":"text","value":"[问题2] 在长方体$ABCD-A_1B_1C_1D_1$的棱所在的直线中，找出与直线$AB$异面的直线．","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L046:para40:skew-definition:2"]},{"role":"solution","type":"text","value":"生 在长方体$ABCD-A_1B_1C_1D_1$中，直线$AB$与$CC_1$是异面直线．","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L046:para43:skew-definition:3"]},{"role":"solution","type":"text","value":"生 直线$AB$与$A_1D_1$也是异面直线．","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L046:para44:skew-definition:4"]},{"role":"context","type":"text","value":"但是，异面直线的定义“不同在任何一个平面上的两条直线”是一种否定性的叙述方式，不便于理解．","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L046:para46:skew-definition:5"]},{"role":"question","type":"text","value":"[问题3] 如何理解异面直线的定义中的“不同在任何一个平面上”？","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L046:para58:skew-definition:6"]},{"role":"question","type":"text","value":"生 “不同在任何一个平面上”是不是就是“分别在两个平面上”？","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L046:para59:skew-definition:7"]},{"role":"solution","type":"text","value":"生 我认为你的说法不正确．比如，在长方体$ABCD-A_1B_1C_1D_1$中，直线$AA_1$与$CC_1$就分别在长方体的两个表面上，但是可以找到一个平面$A_1ACC_1$，使得它们都在这个平面上，所以分别在两个平面上的直线不一定是异面直线．","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L046:para60:skew-definition:8"]},{"role":"solution","type":"text","value":"生 哦，我懂了，“不同在任何一个平面上的两条直线”应该理解为“不存在一个平面，使得这两条直线都在这个平面上”．","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L046:para66:skew-definition:9"]},{"role":"solution","type":"text","value":"同学们讨论的很好，“不同在任何一个平面上”就是“不能在一个平面上”，而共面的两条直线只有平行、相交这两种位置关系，这样，异面直线也可以理解为“既不相交也不平行的两条直线”．","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L046:para67:skew-definition:10"]},{"role":"context","type":"text","value":"经过以上讨论，我们用容易理解的语言来描述异面直线的内涵，帮助我们正确认识异面直线的本质．","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L046:para68:skew-definition:11"]}],"contentOrigin":"source_supported_editorial_summary","wordingStatus":"教案有源整理与数学转写，非逐字引用","matching":{"status":"confirmed","reason":"该具体任务与既有节点对应"},"evidence":[{"id":"ev:book3:L046:para38:skew-definition:0","sourceId":"L046","sourceSha256":"d214b96814c31e980e893179334258ec5a83553394b